{"hw":"καλλίας","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">καλλίας</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">καλλίας</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ου</span> (<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Lacon.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">καλλίαρ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hsch.</span> </span>), <span class=\"lex-gram\">ὁ</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> = πίθηκος, <b class=\"lex-tr\">tame ape</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Din.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.2</span> </span>; <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ion.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">καλλίης</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Herod.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.41</span> </span>: a euphemism, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Gal.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">18(2).236</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">611</span> </span>.</div></div>"}